$model_ah_create_jsonl — build Anthill codegen fine-tune JSONL from .ah files

SUMMARY
  Reads .ah scripts from files[] and writes one JSONL file to files[].

SYNTAX
  @jsonl: @scripts -> $model_ah_create_jsonl

INPUT
  files[] — .ah source texts (e.g. from $folder). Each file should start with:
    # Request: <user task text>
  followed by the full .ah script ending with run @…

OUTPUT
  files[] — one .jsonl link (user = optional request_prefix + # Request text, assistant = script body)

ARGUMENTS
  request_prefix= — optional text prepended to each # Request line (newline added if missing)

PROMPT-CONSUMING
  No.
